    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After transferring to Brightwater Art &amp; Design, a boarding school in Utah, H\u00e1o awakens to find the school's campus overtaken by monstrous creatures taking appearances from people he once knew. Equipped with only a phone, attempt to escape this campus where danger lurks at every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enemies roaming the halls that can't be defeated, H\u00e1o must learn what happened and how to survive in this new world. You'll hide, explore, outsmart, and survive using only your wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive your stay at B.A.D. Institute?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the campus of Brightwater Art &amp; Design to find a way out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun enemies with your phone to escape dangerous situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your surroundings to your advantage to hide from enemy sights\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find papers that influence the course of the story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After transferring to Brightwater Art &amp; Design, a boarding school in Utah, H\u00e1o awakens to find the school's campus overtaken by monstrous creatures taking appearances from people he once knew. Equipped with only a phone, attempt to escape this campus where danger lurks at every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enemies roaming the halls that can't be defeated, H\u00e1o must learn what happened and how to survive in this new world. You'll hide, explore, outsmart, and survive using only your wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive your stay at B.A.D. Institute?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the campus of Brightwater Art &amp; Design to find a way out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun enemies with your phone to escape dangerous situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your surroundings to your advantage to hide from enemy sights\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find papers that influence the course of the story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
